   "slug": "our-story",
   "title": "Our Story",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We met at a bus stop in the rain. Eight years, two cities, one very small flat and one very large dog later, we are getting married.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaType\":\"image\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"{{media:rain}}\" alt=\"Two figures sharing an umbrella\" class=\"size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ea-script\"} --><p class=\"ea-script\">2018</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The umbrella</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A late bus, a borrowed umbrella and three missed stops.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div><!-- /wp:media-text --><!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"mediaPosition\":\"right\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile has-media-on-the-right\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"{{media:lighthouse}}\" alt=\"A lighthouse at sunset\" class=\"size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ea-script\"} --><p class=\"ea-script\">2025</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The question</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>One hundred and twelve steps on a windy evening at Gull Point.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div><!-- /wp:media-text --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Whatever our souls are made of, his and mine are the same — or so it felt on that bus.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Clara, paraphrasing her favourite novel</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --><!-- wp:separator --><hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/><!-- /wp:separator --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Read the whole story in our journal.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "template": "",
   "featured_media": "rain"
  },
