   "slug": "schedule",
   "title": "Schedule",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Here is how the day will unfold. Times are approximate — weddings, like buses, run on their own schedule.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ea-timeline\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group ea-timeline\"><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>14:00</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Guests arrive</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Lemonade under the apple trees.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>14:30</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ceremony</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>In the orchard, beneath the oldest tree.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>15:30</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Photographs &amp; drinks</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Lawn games and a string trio.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>18:00</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dinner</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>One long table in the stone barn.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>20:30</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cake &amp; speeches</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bring tissues; Felix is speaking.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>21:00</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dancing</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>On the terrace until late.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>23:30</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Carriages</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A coach to the station and hotels.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
   "template": "",
   "featured_media": "venue"
  },
  {
   "slug": "travel",
   "title": "Travel & Stay",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Willowmere is small and lovely. Here is how to get there, where to stay and how to get home after the dancing.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:table --><figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Place</th><th>Distance</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>The Willow Inn</td><td>5 minutes</td><td>Rooms held for guests until March</td></tr><tr><td>Mill House B&amp;B</td><td>10 minutes</td><td>Lovely breakfasts</td></tr><tr><td>Station Hotel</td><td>15 minutes</td><td>Coach stops outside</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table --><!-- wp:details --><details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Is there parking?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Yes, free parking at the venue. Please car-share if you can.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></details><!-- /wp:details --><!-- wp:details --><details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Can we bring children?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Absolutely. There will be a children's table, games and a quiet room.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></details><!-- /wp:details --><!-- wp:details --><details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>What if it rains?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The ceremony moves into the stone barn. Bring a pretty umbrella anyway; it is a family tradition.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></details><!-- /wp:details -->",
   "template": "",
   "featured_media": "garden",
   "parent": "schedule"
  },
  {
   "slug": "gallery",
   "title": "Gallery",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">A few of our favourite moments together, and some sneak peeks of the venue.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":3,\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped alignwide\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:lighthouse}}\" alt=\"The lighthouse at sunset\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:rain}}\" alt=\"Umbrella in the rain\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:bouquet}}\" alt=\"Blush roses\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:venue}}\" alt=\"The stone barn\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:rings}}\" alt=\"Rings on a ribbon\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:table}}\" alt=\"Candlelit table\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:cake}}\" alt=\"A three-tier cake with flowers\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:garden}}\" alt=\"The garden path\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:candles}}\" alt=\"Candles and soft lights\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --></figure><!-- /wp:gallery -->",
